{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunt. Hatch. Fight.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dino Card Hunt is a single-player roguelike deckbuilder with auto-battler combat. Scavenge for eggs, hatch Dinos into your party, build your deck from their cards, and arm your hand before each battle. The order you play your cards is the order they execute. Once you hit fight, your Dinos attack automatically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003040/extras/3383fde93130c95ae3d1ba1df088d652.poster.avif?t=1772945080\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003040/extras/3383fde93130c95ae3d1ba1df088d652.webm?t=1772945080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003040/extras/3383fde93130c95ae3d1ba1df088d652.mp4?t=1772945080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Party Mid-Run</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit up to three Dinos during your run. Each one has a role (tank, healer, or damage dealer) and brings its own cards into your deck. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Auto-Battler Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each combat round, draw cards from your deck and spend mana to use them. Arm your cards, hit fight, and your Dinos attack automatically. The order you armed your cards is the order they execute.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An Ever-Changing Island</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run generates a different path of 16 events: enemy encounters, elite fights, merchants, treasure, and rest stops. A boss waits at the end. Choose between risk and safety as you push forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Artifacts</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect artifacts throughout your run. They give passive bonuses and stack. The more you find, the stronger they get.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4003040?t=1772945080","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4003040?t=1772945080","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003040/e8eb029a9e372767037fdb6738d418110d8fb54d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772945080","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003040/e8eb029a9e372767037fdb6738d418110d8fb54d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772945080","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunt. Hatch. Fight.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dino Card Hunt is a single-player roguelike deckbuilder with auto-battler combat. Scavenge for eggs, hatch Dinos into your party, build your deck from their cards, and arm your hand before each battle. The order you play your cards is the order they execute. Once you hit fight, your Dinos attack automatically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003040/extras/3383fde93130c95ae3d1ba1df088d652.poster.avif?t=1772945080\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003040/extras/3383fde93130c95ae3d1ba1df088d652.webm?t=1772945080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.st